OL,3,GNEWSADisruption warning as bridges to
OL,4,Aclose for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being warned of travel
OL,7,Fdisruption ahead of two bridges closing
OL,8,Ffor repairs.
OL,10,FA bridge deck replacement on the U2093
OL,11,Fat Bridekirk Bridge in Cockermouth and
OL,12,Fmaintenance works on the C1041 at
OL,13,FCammock Cottage Bridge, Brisco, near
OL,14,FCarlisle, will go ahead on 1 September.
OL,16,FCumberland Council said the road
OL,17,Fclosure at Bridekirk Bridge would
OL,18,Fcontinue for at least three weeks, with
OL,19,Fthe deck replacement ensuring "the
OL,20,Flong-term safety and resilience of the
OL,21,Fstructure".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
