OL,3,GNEWSADisruption warning as bridges to
OL,4,Aclose for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile Cammock Cottage Bridge will
OL,7,Fbe shut for at least four weeks, with a
OL,8,Fdiversion route signed via the
OL,9,Funrestricted sections of the C1041
OL,10,FBrisco Road, Lamb Street, Scalegate
OL,11,FRoad and Newbiggin Road.
